# the receiver `table`: unit_s7_prim_cross over its own convert.lm2 whose source table stands inside another
# frame, `group:` (tests/unit_s7_tbl_nested_table.lm2). Every source table in an explicitly supplied file
# participates at its written depth (Q46, steps/table-receiver.md section9); the containing named Structure
# is retained at its source place, rather than rejected by the former program-part implementation guard.

fn: go () int
    int: a 1
    size_t: b 2U
    a: b
    return: a

int: k
k: go()
if: k = 2
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 1; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
